---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Me — Harrison Keith"
  description="Executive background, leadership philosophy, and operating principles of J. Harrison Keith."
>
  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-20">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="space-y-6 pb-16 border-b border-bone-300">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-graphite-500">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-burnt-600"></span>
        <span>01 // Background & Leadership Philosophy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-carbon-900 leading-[1.02]">
        The convergence of operational discipline, market architecture, and cultural curiosity.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-graphite-600 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-sans">
        My experience establishes my credibility. My perspective establishes my differentiation.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Editorial Narrative (Movement by Movement) -->
    <div class="py-16 space-y-20 border-b border-bone-300">
      <!-- Movement 1: Operational Foundation -->
      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-burnt-600 font-bold block mb-1">01 / FOUNDATION</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-carbon-900">
            Operational Composure
          </h2>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-graphite-500 uppercase tracking-wider block mt-1">
            U.S. Army Officer
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-4 text-base text-graphite-700 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
          <p>
            Plans survive until the first moment of contact. Leading diverse teams as a U.S. Army Officer in demanding environments taught me that leadership is not charismatic authority—it is the deliberate removal of ambiguity so that front-line teams can act with speed and confidence.
          </p>
          <p>
            I managed multi-million-dollar equipment movements, designed training architectures, and operated under strict mission command: define the objective, set the parameters, and empower decentralized decision-making. That experience permanently calibrated my threshold for pressure, accountability, and execution velocity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Movement 2: Strategic Synthesis -->
      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-burnt-600 font-bold block mb-1">02 / SYNTHESIS</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-carbon-900">
            Market Architecture
          </h2>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-graphite-500 uppercase tracking-wider block mt-1">
            McCombs MBA & Brand Strategy
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-4 text-base text-graphite-700 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
          <p>
            At the University of Texas at Austin's McCombs School of Business, I merged operational discipline with market fundamentals: quantitative customer segmentation, brand equity architecture, and commercial strategy.
          </p>
          <p>
            Advising iconic brands like <strong>Jim Beam</strong> on generational repositioning and researching <strong>YETI's</strong> category elasticity proved that enduring brand value isn't created through marketing hype—it is built in the tension between uncompromising product utility and authentic cultural belonging.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Movement 3: The Cultural Sensor -->
      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-burnt-600 font-bold block mb-1">03 / SENSORY</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-carbon-900">
            Taste as Intelligence
          </h2>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-graphite-500 uppercase tracking-wider block mt-1">
            Endurance & Visual Culture
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-4 text-base text-graphite-700 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
          <p>
            Running limestone trails through the Texas Hill Country and logging miles on endurance bicycles isn't just physical training; it is where mental stamina is built and complex problems are distilled into simple solutions.
          </p>
          <p>
            I study trail footwear ergonomics, typographic grid systems, industrial design specimens, and architectural scale because consumer behavior is deeply physical. Taste is not decorative indulgence; it is the intuition that allows a strategist to recognize quality before the market catches up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Operating Principles (Clean Typographic Ledger, No Boxes) -->
    <section class="py-16 space-y-12 border-b border-bone-300">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-graphite-500 block">
          02 // Core Operating Principles
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-carbon-900">
          How I Think & Operate
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="divide-y divide-bone-300 border-t border-bone-300">
        <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="md:col-span-3 text-xs font-mono text-burnt-600 font-bold">[01] MISSION COMMAND</span>
          <div class="md:col-span-9 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-carbon-900">Decentralized Execution Over Micromanagement</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-graphite-600 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              Articulate the intent, establish clear guardrails, and trust capable people to own the outcome. High-trust teams always move faster than centralized bottlenecks.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="md:col-span-3 text-xs font-mono text-burnt-600 font-bold">[02] TASTE IS LOGIC</span>
          <div class="md:col-span-9 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-carbon-900">Taste as Business Intelligence</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-graphite-600 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              Taste is not superficial styling. It is the ability to recognize craftsmanship, spot cultural inflections early, and make decisions that resonate authentically with discerning audiences.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="md:col-span-3 text-xs font-mono text-burnt-600 font-bold">[03] HIGH AGENCY</span>
          <div class="md:col-span-9 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-carbon-900">Unbound in Curiosity, Directed in Purpose</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-graphite-600 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              Stay broad in inspiration, but ruthless in prioritization. When friction arises, high-agency operators diagnose the root cause and advance without waiting for permission.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="py-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="md:col-span-3 text-xs font-mono text-burnt-600 font-bold">[04] COLLABORATION</span>
          <div class="md:col-span-9 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-carbon-900">Rigor with Human Generosity</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-graphite-600 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
              High standards do not require ego. I bring calm composure, intellectual generosity, and team-first partnership to high-stakes environments.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer Links -->
    <div class="pt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-baseline justify-between gap-6 text-xs font-mono">
      <div class="text-graphite-500 uppercase tracking-widest">
        Next: <a href="/timeline" class="text-burnt-600 hover:text-burnt-700 font-semibold ml-1">Explore Career Timeline &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="/connect" class="text-carbon-900 hover:text-burnt-600 transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest">Start a Dialogue &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
